CLUMondo (github.com/VUEG/CLUMondo a5c0c1f) with its defect corrected, the reference for the corrected form
in ls.simulate (tools/simulate_engines.py runs it as the "clumondo_fixed" engine; build Win32 with MSVC).

calc_age sets the age of restricted cells (region -9998) to -9999 after the first year, so the autonomous
changes the manual says also happen in restricted areas stop after it: here they age like the others.

   patch -p1 < tools/clumondo_fixed.patch

